U[6]:
  When a Three.js or browser game task could match several upstream sub-skills and needs the narrowest single owner
  When the matched upstream sub-skill is not installed yet and must be fetched into the agent skills root
  When work crosses a documented boundary (enemy systems vs monster rig vs enemy AI, combat verbs vs encounter pacing, asset integration vs review assets vs VFX/audio)
